y to provide you with potent recovery support important for the growth and repair of muscles."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"This includes new and improved sources of the ultimate Anabolic Primers: leucine from both a novel potato protein' and slow-digesting casein for a sustained supply of amino acids that support powerful anti-catabolic signals to protect muscles from breaking down, plus 600mg Testofen(R) to trigger the most' powerful Anabolic Hormone in the body required for growth and peak performance with the added benefit of supporting sexual health.\nEvery serious warrior knows you need high-quality rest because intense exercise may contribute to the depletion of critical amino acids and key nutrients."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"PHYSIOBOLIC EDGE The Physiobolic Edge is the advanced, performance-based technology powering the science behind GNC BEYOND RAW(R) with more than best-in-class, cutting-edge ingredients."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Defined by our expert scientists as the \"genesis of the Physiobolic Edge,\" the following 10 Primal Physiogenic Factors are what you need to support extreme training results. Anabolic Hormones Muscle Cell Energy N.O. Pumps Muscle Cell Protection & Recovery Fat Metabolism Increased Calorie Burning Water Regulation Mental Industry & Neuro Priming Anabolic Primers"},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Resveratrol is also included to further aid in the delivery of muscle fuel while priming the blood vessels for N.O. Pumps."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"NATURAL & ARTIFICIAL FLAVAOR"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Indicates Branched Amino Acids (BCAA)"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"After you torture your muscles with extreme training, you need to rest and recover. The RECOVERY POTENTIATOR COMPOUND works to aid in restful sleep and further supports nighttime recovery with GABA to target Neuro Priming. While the PM METABOLIC OPTIMIZER fuels lean muscle and enhances Fat Metabolism with L-carnitine, powerful minerals work to support Muscle Cell Energy, Carbohydrate Metabolism and Water Regulation for maximum recovery power."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"BEYOND RAW(R)RE-FEED supplies the ammunition that every hardcore warrior needs to master extreme training goals and exactly when you need it most — a constant flow of high-quality anabolic, muscle-fueling nutrients. Prepare yourself. Experience the difference. Go beyond basic muscle recovery — get BEYOND RAW(R)."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"BEYOND RAW(R)RE-FEED supplies the ammunition that every hardcore warrior needs to master extreme training goals and exactly when you need it most — a constant flow of high-quality anabolic, muscle-fueling nutrients. Prepare yourself. Experience the difference. Go beyond basic muscle recovery — get BEYOND RAW(R)."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"SUPER ANABOLIC LEAN MUSCLE & NIGHTTIME RECOVERY PROTEIN"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"ULTIMATE HARDCORE, 25G IMMEDIATE & SUSTAINED-RELEASE PROTEIN COMPLEX FOR MUSCLE GROWTH & REPAIR 10G GLUTAMINE COMPLEX PLUS POTENT ANABOLIC MAXIMIZER WITH 52G LEUCINE TO PROTECT DENSE MUSCLE & 600MG TESTOFEN(R) TO SUPPORT HEALTHY TESTOSTERONE LEVELS PM METABOLIC OPTIMIZER REGULATES METABOLISM WITH 250MG L-CARNITINE, GREEN TEA & 200MG GREEN COFFEE AS YOU BATTLE FOR EXTREME MUSCULARITY NOW MORE CONCENTRATED TARGETING 9 PRIMAL PHYSIOGENIC FACTORS FOR BEYOND HARDCORE RESULTS"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"PHYSIOBOLIC EDGE"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","not